  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Flying Back in Network: Assisted Voluntary Return and Reintegration through the Territorial Network</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is intended to make available and promote access to the Assisted Voluntary Return measure in Italy to a total of 2.500 Third Country Nationals (TCNs), including regular and irregular migrants, asylum seekers (rejected, appealed and under consideration) as well as stranded and vulnerable migrants, as well as those defined  with health issues.</narrative>
  </description>
